    "message": "[ipa-delivery:666] build(delivery): request the private IPA666 delivery\n\nFrozen on 54f11bdf (standard_delivery.py freeze, no blocker), base: the\ndelivered and verified IPA 662 (run 42020264926).\n- RPCS3 Core 665 (pin 8f70502f; dylib 955cc610, fingerprint 08753ed1)\n  replaces Core 660: Core 664's PPU grace after starvation (Black Ops II SPU\n  writer-lock storm stalls) and Core 665's thread orchestrator v1 (adaptive\n  SPU placement kept only when the frame rate holds, PPU above the background\n  threads), two test page rows.\n- MeloNX Core 663 (pin 89e1c361; official .NET GC) replaces Core 661, with\n  the host crash journal (MeloNX-crash.log, 9022c1a1).\n- Republished components from the 662 run. Must-change images: the two Cores,\n  both bridges, Runner.\nOffline contract and test/standard_delivery_contract_test.py (56 tests)\npassed; trigger-paths: only the standard delivery jobs run. Private delivery;\nno release, no main change. No device run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-05T17:39:36Z",
